---
/**
 * The slash between the items of a meta line (an article's category, date and reading time; a talk's event, place
 * and date): drawn for the eye (v-sep: a step quieter than the meta text, the line's gap on each side) and hidden from
 * screen readers, which hear a comma (visually hidden) instead, so the items never run together.
 */
---

<span data-sep aria-hidden="true" class="v-sep">/</span><span class="sr-only">, </span>
